' ===========================================================
' LEGEND NOTE
' ===========================================================
note as Legend
  <b>Relationship Types Legend</b>
  ──────────────────────────────
  <b>Generalization</b>  : --|>  (Inheritance / extends)
  <b>Composition</b>     : *--   (Strong ownership, lifecycle)
  <b>Aggregation</b>     : o--   (Weak ownership)
  <b>Association</b>     : -->   (Uses / calls)
  <b>Dependency</b>      : ..>   (Temporary use / query)
end note

